<title>USA: First Union Corp Q3 shr shrinks with charge.</title>
<headline>First Union Corp Q3 shr shrinks with charge.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.60		    $1.36</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.29		    $1.36</p>
<p> Net			357,000		  381,000</p>
<p> Assets	     133,431,000	    120,810,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 274,001		  275,484</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $4.65		    $3.85</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.69		    $3.85</p>
<p> Net		    1,039,000		1,095,000</p>
<p> Assets	     133,541,000	    115,802,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 278,984		  278,721</p>
<p>Avg shrs diluted</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes a one-time, after-tax charge of $86 million to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q3 was $1.59 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
